      "description": "POST /agents/:id/runtime-events — the canonical vocabulary, for adapters that declare runtimeProtocol \"canonical-v1\". A session.state.changed may carry origin {source, seq}; reports whose sequence is not newer than the last accepted from that source are answered 201 {accepted: false, reason: \"stale\"}. Unknown fields are carried, not refused.",
